Privacy
-------

LeafRust does not include analytics, advertising, or tracking SDKs.
Photos and inspections are stored only on the device unless the user
explicitly shares them through the Android system share sheet.
Network access is used only to optionally download/update the TFLite
model from a public GitHub URL.
